{{Quote|I don't understand. Rothana's ships are capable of withstanding most of what the Separatists can deliver in the way of laser&mdash;of projectile fire.|[[Galen Walton Erso]]|<ref name="Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel">''[[Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel]]''</ref>}}
'''Rothana Heavy Engineering''' (or '''RHE''' for short),<ref name="BMF 49" /> also known as '''Rothana Heavy Industries''',<ref name="Rise of the Separatists">''[[Rise of the Separatists]]''</ref> was a subsidiary of the shipbuilding corporation [[Kuat Drive Yards]]<ref name="SOTG" /> that was established sometime after Kuat Yards purchased the [[planet]] [[Rothana]] in [[800 BBY]].<ref name="BMF 49" /> Rothana showcased its latest walker&mdash;the [[Rothana experimental walker]]&mdash;at the [[Valo Republic Fair]]<ref name="The Rising Storm" /> of [[231 BBY]].<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref>

During the [[Clone Wars]], RHE designed and manufactured the [[Acclamator-class transgalactic military assault ship|''Acclamator''-class transgalactic military assault ships]],<ref name="SOTG" /> the [[All Terrain Tactical Enforcer]]s, the [[Low Altitude Assault Transport/infantry]], [[Low Altitude Assault Transport/carrier|Low Altitude Assault Transport carrier]], and the [[Self-Propelled Heavy Artillery]] Turbolaser for the [[Galactic Republic]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> They also manufactured the [[JJ-e5]] [[power cell]]s.<ref name="Epic Battles" />

